OPENSIM

cortenforge-sim-core includes portions ported from OpenSim
(https://github.com/opensim-org/opensim-core), translated to Rust and changed:
its Millard2012EquilibriumMuscle (OpenSim/Actuators), with the force-length and
force-velocity curves built as OpenSim/Common's SmoothSegmentedFunction,
SegmentedQuinticBezierToolkit and SmoothSegmentedFunctionFactory build them,
the fiber kinematics of its MuscleFixedWidthPennationModel, its fiber damping,
its minimum fiber length clamp and its floor on the tendon force. OpenSim's
source code is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0, the text in the
